# One hostname, chosen rather than left to Google.
#
# Both volobg3.com and www.volobg3.com served the whole site at 200, so Search
# Console indexed both and split the clicks between them: 16 to the apex and 12
# to www over the first eight days. Every link, impression and ranking signal
# was being divided across two properties that are the same site.
#
# The canonical tag has always pointed at the apex and did not settle it. A
# canonical is a hint; a 301 is not, so the redirect is what actually decides.
#
# :splat carries the rest of the path, so a link to a deep page keeps working
# rather than dumping somebody on the home page.
https://www.volobg3.com/*  https://volobg3.com/:splat  301!
